# tool_call 真实工具批（自造，2026-08-24）：题面工具用 tools_ref 从生产 46 件工具的冻结
# 快照（real_tool_schemas.json）按名解析，每题 8–12 件并强制放同族诱导项。种子批的玩具
# 工具（get_weather/calculator，≤3 件）全模型满分、无区分度；这一批测的是**在真实工具面
# 前的选择与构参**：嵌套结构参数、日期精确格式、布尔/枚举、按描述辨析同族工具、闭环整合、
# 以及「该问用户就别猜」的克制。判分全部规则化（matchers 词汇），零 LLM 评审。
{"id": "tc-real-001", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "render_chart 的主用面：数字在对话里、要出图给用户看。测嵌套结构参数——labels 字符串数组与 series 对象数组须同时成形；诱导项 excel_research/write_document 会把「做张图」误接成做表做文档"}, "task": {"user": "2026 财年四个季度的销售额分别是：Q1 120 万、Q2 138 万、Q3 96 万、Q4 155 万。做一张柱状图给我看看。", "tools_ref": ["render_chart", "excel_research", "run_math", "math_research", "write_document", "write_file", "file_extract", "notify_user", "clipboard_write", "run_shell_command"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "render_chart", "args": {"chart_type": {"eq": "bar"}, "labels": {"type": "array", "contains_all": ["Q1", "Q4"]}, "series": {"type": "array", "regex": "(?<![0-9])96(?![0-9])"}, "title": {"optional": true, "type": "string"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-002", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "多系列折线图：两个城市的同月数据必须落进两个 series 对象而不是拍平成一条。系列名来自数据本身（工具描述明令 never rename data values），是可程序化断言的锚点；与 001 同工具不同结构面"}, "task": {"user": "Monthly average highs last year: Tokyo 9, 12, 17, 22 for Jan-Apr; Osaka 10, 13, 18, 23 for the same months. Plot them as a line chart so I can compare the two cities.", "tools_ref": ["render_chart", "run_math", "excel_research", "write_document", "media_download", "web_read", "file_extract", "notify_user", "run_shell_command"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "render_chart", "args": {"chart_type": {"eq": "line"}, "labels": {"type": "array", "regex": "(?i)jan"}, "series": {"type": "array", "regex": "(?s)\\{[^{}]*Tokyo[^{}]*\\}[^{}]*\\{[^{}]*Osaka[^{}]*\\}|\\{[^{}]*Osaka[^{}]*\\}[^{}]*\\{[^{}]*Tokyo[^{}]*\\}"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-003", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "定时任务是本项目自有能力：spec 是嵌套对象且形态由 type 决定（daily 要 at）。诱导项 reminder_add/calendar_add 会把「每天自动做一件事」误接成提醒或日程——那是一次性事件，不会自动执行 prompt"}, "task": {"user": "以后每天早上 8:00 自动帮我把 ~/Documents/inbox 里新增的文件列一遍，然后发个通知给我。", "tools_ref": ["schedule_create", "schedule_update", "schedule_list", "reminder_add", "calendar_add", "notify_user", "list_dir", "find_files", "run_shell_command", "write_file"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "schedule_create", "args": {"name": {"type": "string"}, "prompt": {"type": "string", "regex": "(?i)inbox"}, "spec": {"type": "object", "contains_all": ["daily", "08:00"]}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-004", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "web_read 的 urls 是数组且只吃用户给定的页面（不会搜索）。测两条 URL 都要进数组、顺序无关；诱导项 open_path 会把「读这两个页面」误接成在浏览器里打开，media_download 则误接成下载"}, "task": {"user": "Read these two pages and tell me how their pricing differs: https://example.com/pricing and https://example.org/plans", "tools_ref": ["web_read", "open_path", "media_download", "find_files", "file_extract", "write_document", "clipboard_write", "notify_user", "run_shell_command", "list_dir"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "web_read", "args": {"urls": {"type": "array", "contains_all": ["example.com/pricing", "example.org/plans"]}, "question": {"optional": true, "type": "string"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-005", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "会话式注册 API 工具是本项目特色能力：params 是 JSON Schema 片段（嵌套对象），auth_env 必须是环境变量名而非密钥本身——题面刻意只给变量名 RATE_API_KEY，守的是「声明里不得出现真钥」这条红线"}, "task": {"user": "公司内网有个汇率接口 https://api.example.internal/v1/rate，要传 base 和 quote 两个查询参数，密钥我已经放进环境变量 RATE_API_KEY 了。把它登记成一个以后能直接调用的工具吧。", "tools_ref": ["register_api_tool", "register_skill", "write_file", "edit_file", "run_shell_command", "web_read", "schedule_create", "notify_user", "clipboard_write"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "register_api_tool", "args": {"name": {"regex": "^[a-z0-9_]+$"}, "description": {"type": "string"}, "endpoint": {"contains": "api.example.internal/v1/rate"}, "params": {"type": "object", "contains_all": ["base", "quote"]}, "auth_env": {"eq": "RATE_API_KEY"}, "method": {"optional": true, "type": "string"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-006", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "技能剧本注册：requires 是字符串数组，必须点名剧本依赖的工具。测的是「把一段可复用流程结构化」而不是当场执行；诱导项 write_document/schedule_create 会把 register 误接成直接产文档或排定时"}, "task": {"user": "Write me a reusable playbook for my weekly report: list the files changed in ~/work that week, summarize them, and save the summary as a Word document. Register it so I can reuse it later.", "tools_ref": ["register_skill", "register_api_tool", "write_document", "write_file", "schedule_create", "list_dir", "find_files", "run_shell_command", "notify_user", "edit_file"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "register_skill", "args": {"name": {"regex": "^[a-z0-9-]+$"}, "description": {"type": "string"}, "body": {"type": "string"}, "requires": {"type": "array", "contains": "write_document"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-007", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "reminder_add 的 due 是「YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM」死格式：题面把绝对日期写进用户话里（不留 today 歧义），测中文口语时刻「下午四点半」→ 16:30 的 24 小时制换算与补零，格式错在生产里就是建不上提醒"}, "task": {"user": "2026 年 9 月 3 日下午四点半提醒我交房租。", "tools_ref": ["reminder_add", "calendar_add", "schedule_create", "notify_user", "schedule_list", "get_current_time", "clipboard_write", "write_file", "run_shell_command", "open_path"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "reminder_add", "args": {"title": {"regex": "(?i)房租"}, "due": {"eq": "2026-09-03 16:30"}, "list": {"optional": true, "type": "string"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-008", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "calendar_add：when 死格式 + duration_minutes 是整数（不是 '45' 字符串，方言类型还原正是测量点）。英式日期 '12 March 2026' 要正确重排成 2026-03-12，日/月颠倒是这一格式的经典翻车点"}, "task": {"user": "Block out a 45-minute design review with Mei on 12 March 2026 starting at 10:00.", "tools_ref": ["calendar_add", "reminder_add", "schedule_create", "calendar_list", "notify_user", "get_current_time", "clipboard_write", "write_file", "run_shell_command"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "calendar_add", "args": {"title": {"regex": "(?i)design review"}, "when": {"eq": "2026-03-12 10:00"}, "duration_minutes": {"eq": 45, "type": "integer"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-009", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "ja", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "日本語面の一回限りスケジュール：spec.type=once では at が「YYYY-MM-DD HH:MM」の絶対時刻。用户在日语环境，日文任务面必须覆盖；测 once 分支的嵌套 spec 与绝对时刻格式"}, "task": {"user": "2026年12月24日の18:00に一度だけ、その日の作業ログをまとめて通知するようにしておいて。", "tools_ref": ["schedule_create", "schedule_update", "schedule_list", "reminder_add", "calendar_add", "notify_user", "get_current_time", "write_file", "run_shell_command", "clipboard_write"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "schedule_create", "args": {"name": {"type": "string"}, "prompt": {"type": "string"}, "spec": {"type": "object", "contains_all": ["once", "2026-12-24 18:00"]}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-010", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "时长要从「9 点到 11 点」推出来（120 分钟），不是照抄默认 60——测的是把区间换算成 duration_minutes 整数的推理，配合 when 的死格式；与 008 同工具但考点相反（008 给时长，010 给区间）"}, "task": {"user": "2026 年 10 月 1 日上午 9 点到 11 点是部门例会，加到日历里。", "tools_ref": ["calendar_add", "calendar_list", "reminder_add", "schedule_create", "notify_user", "get_current_time", "write_file", "clipboard_write", "run_shell_command"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "calendar_add", "args": {"title": {"regex": "(?i)例会"}, "when": {"eq": "2026-10-01 09:00"}, "duration_minutes": {"eq": 120, "type": "integer"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-011", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "find_files 的 search_content 默认 false 只搜文件名；用户明说「文件名想不起来、正文里有这几个字」，不置 true 就搜不到。测从自然语言推出布尔开关 + folder 限定；诱导项 list_dir/run_shell_command 常被误选"}, "task": {"user": "有份文件正文里写了「年度预算复核」这几个字，文件名我实在想不起来了，在 ~/Documents 底下帮我找出来。", "tools_ref": ["find_files", "list_dir", "file_extract", "open_path", "run_shell_command", "web_read", "trash_file", "move_file", "write_file", "clipboard_write"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "find_files", "args": {"query": {"regex": "年度预算复核"}, "search_content": {"optional": true, "eq": true, "type": "boolean"}, "folder": {"regex": "(?i)documents"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-012", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "chart_type 是枚举（bar/barh/line/pie/scatter）：占比问题应选 pie 而非默认 bar，且饼图只有一个 series、labels 是切片名。与 001/002 构成同工具的枚举分支对照"}, "task": {"user": "Our traffic last month split like this: search 48%, direct 27%, social 15%, referral 10%. Show me the share as a pie chart.", "tools_ref": ["render_chart", "excel_research", "run_math", "write_document", "math_research", "file_extract", "notify_user", "clipboard_write", "run_shell_command"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "render_chart", "args": {"chart_type": {"eq": "pie"}, "labels": {"type": "array", "regex": "(?i)search"}, "series": {"type": "array", "contains": "48"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-013", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "list_dir 的 show_hidden 默认 false：'dotfiles included' 是唯一线索，漏了这个布尔就答不全。诱导项 find_files（搜而非列）与 run_shell_command（ls -a 万能锤）都是真实误选形态"}, "task": {"user": "Show me everything inside ~/Projects/agent, dotfiles included.", "tools_ref": ["list_dir", "find_files", "file_extract", "open_path", "run_shell_command", "trash_file", "move_file", "copy_file", "write_file"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "list_dir", "args": {"path": {"contains": "Projects/agent"}, "show_hidden": {"eq": true, "type": "boolean"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-014", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "media_download 的 mode 枚举（probe/audio/video）默认 probe：用户只要声音就必须显式 audio，默认值会只回元数据。测「默认值不等于用户要的值」这一类枚举纪律，URL 须原样照抄不得改写"}, "task": {"user": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=dQw4w9WgXcQ 这个视频我只要声音，音频抓下来给我。", "tools_ref": ["media_download", "web_read", "open_path", "file_extract", "find_files", "write_file", "notify_user", "clipboard_write", "run_shell_command"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "media_download", "args": {"url": {"contains": "dQw4w9WgXcQ"}, "mode": {"eq": "audio"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-015", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "run_math vs math_research 的分水岭写在描述里：一次算完的多位数算术走 run_math，多步依赖才走 math_research。测的是读描述做路由，而不是看见「数学」就派研究子模块（后者贵一个数量级）"}, "task": {"user": "87654 × 3219 是多少？", "tools_ref": ["run_math", "math_research", "excel_research", "render_chart", "run_shell_command", "write_file", "clipboard_write", "notify_user", "file_extract", "get_current_time"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "run_math", "args": {"code": {"regex": "87654"}, "timeout": {"optional": true, "type": "integer"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-016", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "反向分水岭：三问互相依赖（先算溢出时刻、再据此算废水量与均速）属描述里点名的 multi-step，走 math_research；且 problem 必须自足——子模块看不到对话，漏一个数就白算，故断言每个数字都在"}, "task": {"user": "A tank fills at 12 L/min while draining at 4.5 L/min. It starts with 80 L and holds 500 L. How long until it overflows, how much water goes down the drain by then, and what is the average net fill rate over that period?", "tools_ref": ["math_research", "run_math", "excel_research", "render_chart", "write_document", "run_shell_command", "file_extract", "notify_user", "web_read"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "math_research", "args": {"problem": {"type": "string", "contains_all": ["12", "4.5", "80", "500"]}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-017", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "「删掉、但还能捞回来」正对 trash_file 的描述（移入废纸篓、可恢复）；run_shell_command 的 rm 与 move_file 都是不可恢复或语义不符的近邻。破坏性动作选错工具在生产里是不可逆事故"}, "task": {"user": "~/Desktop/旧版发票.pdf 这个文件不要了，删掉吧。万一以后还要用，得能捞得回来。", "tools_ref": ["trash_file", "move_file", "copy_file", "run_shell_command", "find_files", "list_dir", "open_path", "write_file", "file_extract"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "trash_file", "args": {"path": {"regex": "旧版发票"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-018", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "用户给了 URL 且只要这一页的摘要 → web_read（描述明写「限于给定页面时才用」）；open_path 会把页面在浏览器里打开却什么都没读到，是本项目实测里最常见的误选之一"}, "task": {"user": "Here's the link: https://blog.example.com/posts/42 - summarize the author's main argument for me.", "tools_ref": ["web_read", "open_path", "media_download", "file_extract", "find_files", "clipboard_write", "write_document", "notify_user", "run_shell_command"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "web_read", "args": {"urls": {"type": "array", "contains": "blog.example.com/posts/42"}, "question": {"optional": true, "type": "string"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-019", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "改一行已有文件 → edit_file 的精确串替换（描述里写明 write_file 只用于新建或整体重写）。测 old_string/new_string 是否照抄原文而不是整文件重写——整文件重写丢内容是本仓有案底的真实事故"}, "task": {"user": "In ~/proj/config.yaml there is a line that reads `timeout: 30`. Change it to 90 and leave everything else exactly as it is.", "tools_ref": ["edit_file", "write_file", "write_document", "file_extract", "find_files", "list_dir", "run_shell_command", "move_file", "copy_file", "trash_file"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "edit_file", "args": {"path": {"contains": "config.yaml"}, "old_string": {"regex": "timeout:\\s*30"}, "new_string": {"regex": "timeout:\\s*90"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-020", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "「挪过去、原处别留」= move_file 而非 copy_file（描述里两者只差保不保留源）。测同族双工具里由一句限定语决定的取舍，destination 给的是目标文件夹（描述说是目录就移进去保留原名）（08-24 首跑七档全走 run_shell_command——其描述自称 PRIMARY，留它在场测不出 move_file 择器，剔出干扰项）"}, "task": {"user": "把 ~/Downloads/report-2026Q1.pdf 挪到 ~/Documents/报告/ 文件夹里，Downloads 里就别留了。", "tools_ref": ["move_file", "copy_file", "trash_file", "write_file", "find_files", "list_dir", "open_path", "file_extract"]}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "move_file", "args": {"source": {"contains": "report-2026Q1.pdf"}, "destination": {"regex": "报告"}}, "allow_extra": true}}}
{"id": "tc-real-021", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "闭环：算术交给沙箱后必须把沙箱的数原样报给用户（描述明令「沙箱是对的、你的记忆是错的」）。回喂 407.5，终答不含这个数就是自己心算或改写了结果——这正是本项目要拦的编造面"}, "task": {"user": "一箱苹果 23.5 元，我要买 17 箱，另外还有 8 元的配送费，一共多少钱？", "tools_ref": ["run_math", "math_research", "excel_research", "render_chart", "clipboard_write", "notify_user", "write_file", "run_shell_command", "file_extract", "get_current_time"], "tool_responses": {"run_math": "407.5"}}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "run_math", "args": {"code": {"regex": "23\\.5"}}, "allow_extra": true}, "final": {"regex_any": ["407\\.5"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-022", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "闭环：读页面 → 把页面里的价格整合进终答。回喂里同时有 Starter/Pro/Enterprise 三档，只有 Pro 的 49 是答案，测的是从工具回执里挑对字段而不是复述整段"}, "task": {"user": "What does the Pro plan cost per month? The page is https://example.com/pricing", "tools_ref": ["web_read", "open_path", "media_download", "find_files", "file_extract", "write_document", "notify_user", "clipboard_write", "run_shell_command"], "tool_responses": {"web_read": {"digest": "[来源1] example.com/pricing - Starter $19/month, Pro $49/month, Enterprise: custom pricing."}}}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "web_read", "args": {"urls": {"type": "array", "contains": "example.com/pricing"}}, "allow_extra": true}, "final": {"regex_any": ["\\b49\\b"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-023", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "闭环 + 参数类型：file_extract 的 page 是字符串页码规格（'3' 不是 3），path 取自出处标记 [原文件：…]。回喂给一段合同正文，终答须把押金数字原样报出——已入库文件问答是本项目日常主用面"}, "task": {"user": "[原文件：/Users/me/Downloads/租约.pdf] 这份租约第 3 页写的押金是多少？", "tools_ref": ["file_extract", "find_files", "list_dir", "open_path", "web_read", "excel_research", "run_shell_command", "write_file", "clipboard_write", "notify_user"], "tool_responses": {"file_extract": {"path": "/Users/me/Downloads/租约.pdf", "page": "3", "text": "第七条 押金：本合同押金为 180000 元，租期届满且无违约时无息退还。"}}}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "file_extract", "args": {"path": {"eq": "/Users/me/Downloads/租约.pdf"}, "page": {"eq": "3"}}, "allow_extra": true}, "final": {"regex_any": ["180[,，]?000", "18\\s*万"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-024", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "ja", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "闭环：表計算の編集依頼は excel_research（読むだけなら file_extract）。file_path は出処マーカーからそのまま渡し、GO 回执里的下载链接必须原样转达给用户——链接不转达等于交付失败"}, "task": {"user": "[原文件：/Users/me/Desktop/売上2026.xlsx] 支店ごとの合計行を追加してください。", "tools_ref": ["excel_research", "file_extract", "render_chart", "write_document", "run_math", "math_research", "write_file", "run_shell_command", "notify_user"], "tool_responses": {"excel_research": "GO — 納品物: http://127.0.0.1:14160/files/売上2026_updated.xlsx （全 12 式を再計算、変更半径チェック合格）"}}, "expect": {"type": "tool_call", "call": {"name": "excel_research", "args": {"task": {"type": "string", "regex": "(?i)合計|合计"}, "file_path": {"eq": "/Users/me/Desktop/売上2026.xlsx"}}, "allow_extra": true}, "final": {"must_any": ["売上2026_updated.xlsx"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-025", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "常识问答摆在 run_shell_command 这把万能锤面前：描述说它是 PRIMARY tool，正是最强的误触发源。测「有工具不等于该用工具」——生产里乱开终端会弹审批框骚扰用户，克制率直接影响可用性"}, "task": {"user": "为什么天空是蓝色的？", "tools_ref": ["run_shell_command", "web_read", "find_files", "list_dir", "file_extract", "open_path", "notify_user", "clipboard_write", "write_file"]}, "expect": {"type": "no_call", "final": {"must_any": ["散射", "瑞利", "蓝光", "波长", "scatter", "Rayleigh", "wavelength", "blue light"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-026", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "闰年天数是固定常识，与「现在几点」无关：get_current_time 是诱导项（描述已声明系统提示里就有日期）。run_math 同样在场——为这种题开算术沙箱也是失守。测无谓工具调用的抑制"}, "task": {"user": "How many days does a leap year have?", "tools_ref": ["get_current_time", "calendar_list", "calendar_add", "reminder_add", "run_math", "schedule_list", "notify_user", "run_shell_command", "clipboard_write"]}, "expect": {"type": "no_call", "final": {"regex_any": ["\\b366\\b"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-027", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "纯寒暄收尾：notify_user / reminder_add / schedule_create 都可能被「talk to you tomorrow」误触发成建提醒或排定时任务。测的是社交话轮不产生副作用——生产里凭寒暄建日程是用户最反感的失控形态"}, "task": {"user": "Thanks, that's everything for today. Talk to you tomorrow!", "tools_ref": ["notify_user", "clipboard_write", "reminder_add", "calendar_add", "schedule_create", "run_shell_command", "write_file", "get_current_time", "system_status"]}, "expect": {"type": "no_call", "final": {"must_any": ["welcome", "Welcome", "glad", "Glad", "anytime", "Anytime", "care", "Care"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-028", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "编程常识问答：run_shell_command（跑个 python 试试）与 web_read（查文档）都是似是而非的诱导。本项目大量对话就是这类直答题，一调工具就多一轮审批与延迟，克制率是档位路由的硬指标"}, "task": {"user": "Python 里 list 和 tuple 到底有什么区别？", "tools_ref": ["run_shell_command", "run_math", "find_files", "file_extract", "web_read", "write_file", "edit_file", "register_skill", "notify_user"]}, "expect": {"type": "no_call", "final": {"must_any": ["不可变", "可变", "immutable", "mutable"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-029", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "zh", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "calendar_add 的描述明写「缺日期/时长这类细节要先问用户，别猜」：题面只给了事由没给时间，正确行为是反问而不是编一个时间。判分按 no_call + 终答含疑问词，测的是不编造必填参数"}, "task": {"user": "帮我在日历上加一个和田中的会议。", "tools_ref": ["calendar_add", "calendar_list", "reminder_add", "schedule_create", "notify_user", "clipboard_write", "write_file", "run_shell_command", "find_files"]}, "expect": {"type": "no_call", "final": {"must_any": ["几点", "什么时候", "哪天", "请问"]}}}
{"id": "tc-real-030", "dimension": "tool_call", "lang": "en", "source": {"origin": "self", "fit": "同一条纪律的英文面：'add a dentist appointment' 没给日期与时刻，when 是必填且不可推断，猜一个时间就是把错事件写进用户真实日历。正确行为是回问，故按 no_call + 疑问句判"}, "task": {"user": "Add a dentist appointment to my calendar.", "tools_ref": ["calendar_add", "calendar_list", "reminder_add", "schedule_create", "notify_user", "clipboard_write", "write_file", "run_shell_command", "list_dir"]}, "expect": {"type": "no_call", "final": {"must_any": ["what time", "What time", "which", "Which", "when", "When"]}}}
